# Library Crate Conventions

## Repo identity
This is **`promptfleet-agents`** — the **public OSS** Rust crate library. All crates under `crates/`. This repo is a standalone library consumed by downstream projects.

## Dependency discipline
Crates here must be **self-contained**. No dependencies on external proprietary packages. Only depend on published crates or other crates within this workspace.

## Public API discipline
- Every public type, trait, and function should have a doc comment — this will be published.
- Avoid exposing internal implementation details. Use `pub(crate)` for crate-internal items.
- Breaking changes to public APIs affect downstream consumers — coordinate carefully.

## WASM target
All crates must compile to `wasm32-wasi` except `pf_test_harness` (native-only test infra).

## Testing
- Run tests: `cargo test -p <crate>`
- `pf_test_harness` provides `LlmScenario`, `TestPipeline`, `SseCollector`, and `a2a_http` helpers for integration tests.
- Never update `ai_changelogs.md` before tests pass.
